 "meta": {
  "note": "Footprints are rough estimates (order of magnitude from Poore & Nemecek 2018 category medians via Our World in Data, adjusted by item); airShareFar and glassMonths are modelling assumptions. Verify before relying on single numbers. hubReexport lists intra-EU dispatch hubs whose volume is redistributed over the other origins (Comext reports intra-EU trade by country of dispatch, so NL/BE hide the true origin of tropical fruit). originRef items take their origin mix from EU27-level Comext (extra-EU trade is recorded by origin) and scale it to the importing country's total volume. hestiaProduct maps an item to its HESTIA (hestia.earth) product name; when the item's dominant import origin that month has a HESTIA per-country GWP100 value (data/raw/hestia_gwp100.json), it replaces productionFieldKgPerKg for that origin (unheated scenarios only)."
